#. module: account_due_reminder
#: model:mail.template,body_html:account_due_reminder.reminder_email_template_1
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != object.commercial_partner_id."
"id\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-out=\"object."
"commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>),</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/"
">,</t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        It has come to our attention that you have&nbsp;an "
"outstanding balance of <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.total_overdue, "
"object.currency_id) or ''\"/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        We kindly request that you take necessary action to "
"settle this amount within the next 8 days.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        </p><div t-if=\"object._show_pay_now_button()\" "
"class=\"d-flex\">\n"
"                            <a t-att-href=\"'/my/invoices/overdue'\" "
"class=\"btn btn-primary\">Pay now</a>\n"
"                        </div>\n"
"                        If you have already made the payment after "
"receiving this message, please disregard it.\n"
"                        Our accounting department is available if you "
"require any assistance or have any questions.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Thank you for your cooperation.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Sincerely,\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty(object."
"_get_reminder_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_reminder_responsible()."
"signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            --\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_reminder_responsible()."
"name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    \n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != object.commercial_partner_id."
"id\">Hej <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-out=\"object."
"commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>),</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Hej <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/>,"
"</t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Det har kommit till vår kännedom att du har ett "
"utestående saldo på <t t-out=\"format_amount(object.total_overdue, object."
"currency_id) or ''\"/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Vi ber dig vänligen att vidta nödvändiga åtgärder "
"för att reglera detta belopp inom de närmaste 8 dagarna.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        </p><div t-if=\"object._show_pay_now_button()\" "
"class=\"d-flex\">\n"
"                            <a t-att-href=\"'/my/invoices/overdue'\" "
"class=\"btn btn-primary\">Betala nu</a>\n"
"                        </div>\n"
"                         Om du redan har gjort betalningen efter att ha "
"mottagit detta meddelande, vänligen bortse från det.\n"
"                        Vår ekonomiavdelning finns tillgänglig om du "
"behöver hjälp eller har några frågor.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Tack för ditt samarbete.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Vänligen,\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty(object."
"_get_reminder_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_reminder_responsible()."
"signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            --\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_reminder_responsible()."
"name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    \n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "

#. module: account_due_reminder
#: model:mail.template,body_html:account_due_reminder.reminder_email_template_2
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != object.commercial_partner_id."
"id\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-out=\"object."
"commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>),</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/"
">,</t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        We are disappointed to see that despite sending a "
"reminder, that your account is now seriously overdue.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        It is essential that immediate payment is made, "
"otherwise we will have to consider placing a stop on your account which "
"means that we will no longer be able to supply your company with (goods/"
"services). Please, take appropriate measures in order to carry out this "
"payment in the next 8 days.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        If there is a problem with paying invoice that we "
"are not aware of, do not hesitate to contact our accounting department, so "
"that we can resolve the matter quickly.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Details of due payments is printed below.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Best Regards,\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty(object."
"_get_reminder_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_reminder_responsible()."
"signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            --\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_reminder_responsible()."
"name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != object.commercial_partner_id."
"id\">Hej <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-out=\"object."
"commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>),</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Hej <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/>,"
"</t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Vi är besvikna över att se att trots att vi skickat "
"en påminnelse, så är ditt konto nu allvarligt försenat.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Det är viktigt att omedelbar betalning sker, annars "
"måste vi överväga att sätta ett stopp på ditt konto vilket innebär att vi "
"inte längre kommer att kunna förse ditt företag med (varor/tjänster). "
"Vänligen vidta lämpliga åtgärder för att genomföra denna betalning inom de "
"närmaste 8 dagarna.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Om det uppstår problem med betalningen av fakturan "
"som vi inte känner till, tveka inte att kontakta vår ekonomiavdelning, så "
"att vi snabbt kan lösa problemet.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Detaljer om förfallna betalningar finns utskrivna "
"nedan.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Vänligeh,\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty(object."
"_get_reminder_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_reminder_responsible()."
"signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            --\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_reminder_responsible()."
"name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "

